# Forgotten Monument: "{T}: Add {C}. Other Caves you control have '{T}, Pay 1 life: Add one mana of any color.'" (CR 613.1f).
# Before it arrives, Bot1's Captivating Cave has no pay-1-life ability (refused on turn 3). Once the
# Monument is out the Cave makes {U} for exactly 1 life (Bot1 20 -> 19); the Monument itself ("other") has no such ability, only
# {T}: Add {C}, and the Island Bot1 controls, no Cave, has none; the Cave Bot2 controls (not "you control") has none either.

